Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.44,0:00:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The End
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.84,0:00:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,North latitude 28 degrees 24 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.74,0:00:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,West longitude 80 degrees 36 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.30,0:00:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Go there, and wait patiently\Nfor the next new moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That, my friend, is when heaven will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no further use for this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The child that was born is\Nalready in my possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.96,0:00:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the story of Jailhouse Locke.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.26,0:00:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Try as you might, you can only\Nremember three things at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.90,0:00:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I need something, but what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's important?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's something I cannot forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something important to tell\NJolene. I gotta go. She needs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.24,0:00:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.42,0:00:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.94,0:01:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.85,0:01:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,something...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.77,0:01:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.76,0:01:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.80,0:01:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.54,0:01:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would he go into that building?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.94,0:01:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand this show!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.04,0:01:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let it play!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.36,0:01:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you always have to keep\Non doing what you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the remote from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.82,0:01:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what the\Nfuck is happening anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.48,0:01:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And drag her dumb ass out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.32,0:01:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.68,0:01:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I won't watch it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.16,0:01:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You happy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, newbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.84,0:01:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That there spider's the boss of this cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, good to meet you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope we can get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.76,0:01:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They call me Ron the Viper.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.32,0:01:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, yeah, of course. Appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And that spider over there\Nis on the brink of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.82,0:01:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, sup, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.20,0:01:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.24,0:01:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell is any of\Nthis supposed to be funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.98,0:01:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this comic book is a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.80,0:01:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.66,0:01:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I? The rec room?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.38,0:02:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have had a good\Nreason to come in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.46,0:02:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I have to go see Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.46,0:02:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to find another way to\Nbreak out of this place, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the medical wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.62,0:02:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio's room is off that staircase.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.00,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's usually a walk in the park,\Nbut they beefed up security today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So how do I get to Emporio in one piece?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.26,0:02:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit! It's a stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.16,0:02:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know I've seen it before! The enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.80,0:02:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to go after it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.62,0:02:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And that woman's the user!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.64,0:03:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be able to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.84,0:03:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.75,0:03:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be a trap and a hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.08,0:03:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be a trap and a hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.68,0:03:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.86,0:03:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a survival day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.90,0:03:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.10,0:03:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.54,0:03:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.62,0:03:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.82,0:03:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.22,0:03:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.38,0:04:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.16,0:04:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,don't stop beating,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,don't stop beating,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.71,0:04:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.04,0:05:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.20,0:05:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And who was I chasing after just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.42,0:05:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What is happening? I caught her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.54,0:05:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're at the corner of hallway D12.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.62,0:05:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You, hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.54,0:05:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.46,0:05:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The one being chased right now is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.20,0:05:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! Here she comes! Hey! Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.91,0:05:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn there were\Ntwo guards there a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.84,0:05:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.16,0:05:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.44,0:05:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, how did I even get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they all after me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.92,0:06:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.88,0:06:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I saw her head that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.58,0:06:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.49,0:06:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Go move your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.41,0:06:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way she just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.86,0:06:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got to be hiding somewhere close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.70,0:06:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she ran toward the stairwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.70,0:06:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.68,0:06:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She would have had to pass right by us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd have seen her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.60,0:06:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The stairwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.12,0:06:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Go see Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.96,0:06:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's coming back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.76,0:06:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the stairs that\Nlead to Emporio's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.76,0:06:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What was I doing just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I spilled the water\Nand it went everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.52,0:06:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I need to tell Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.48,0:06:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get to her before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.54,0:07:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have to write somewhere\Nelse before I forget it all again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.44,0:07:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to make sure she sees the mugshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.86,0:07:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Or else I won't be able to tell her...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.06,0:07:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,tell her that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.36,0:07:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.90,0:07:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you can only retain up\Nto three memories at a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.02,0:07:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,even if there are four\Nguards chasing after you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.58,0:07:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll only be able to\Nremember three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.70,0:07:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course your eyes will be able to see\Nall of them totaling more than four,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.60,0:07:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but your brain will outright\Nreject them as a memory
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Go see Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.12,0:07:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I made you guide me here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting who would have\Nthought I'd find a secret room
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.78,0:07:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.92,0:08:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,J-Jolene, when did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.48,0:08:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I just showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.74,0:08:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.18,0:08:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor you, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.36,0:08:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.86,0:08:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is this because you can\Nonly remember three things,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,These two?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.29,0:08:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My arms have the exact\Nsame writing on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.04,0:08:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since being in solitary!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.14,0:08:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I remember now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.00,0:08:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to talk to you, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.44,0:08:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something really\Nimportant I need to tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.76,0:08:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening to me? Uh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.06,0:08:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, what was I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.46,0:08:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey wait, when did you get here,\NJolene? And why? Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.76,0:08:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, why, why, why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.44,0:08:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.84,0:08:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to see you and it's urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.60,0:08:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have no idea why.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.40,0:08:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I just knew that if I didn't\Ncome, I'd be up Schitt's Creek.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.34,0:08:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Print it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.40,0:08:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I've gotta print it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.86,0:08:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And fast, or else I'm\Ngonna forget it forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.54,0:08:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only way I can save it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.80,0:08:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Print what out, Emporio?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.40,0:08:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean when\Nyou say print it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.34,0:08:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I, um, what was...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.84,0:08:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,was it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.94,0:09:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.36,0:09:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Name, Miu Miu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Rank, Chief Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.02,0:09:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.92,0:09:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So last time we met, that little\Nrat was there with you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.74,0:09:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He saw my face and my\Nstand, and he heard my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.52,0:09:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That Emporio was inside the\Nwall in the solitary cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.72,0:09:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Usually, I'd leave him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.60,0:09:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My jailhouse lock's duty is to\Nspot who the stand users are,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,track them down, and make\Nsure they're locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.22,0:09:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But if there's any evidence of me\Nout there, that's another story.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.34,0:09:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand down, you jailbreaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.82,0:09:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Her stand, Stone Ocean, is too strong, so\Nthese bullets will be useless against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.62,0:09:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know you won't remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.78,0:09:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That if I had shot four bullets at you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.64,0:09:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,you would have no clue\Nwhere the last bullet went.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.72,0:09:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd piss your pants not knowing\Nwhether it hit you or missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.62,0:09:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't even be able to see or smell\None wisp of smoke from the gunpowder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.34,0:10:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,J. Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.36,0:10:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.64,0:10:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why there's a room\Nnor why there's a kid here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.56,0:10:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole thing sure\Nsmells suspicious as fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.20,0:10:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Although Palesnake\Nmentions somebody in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.58,0:10:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Is in cahoots with Jolene,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.28,0:10:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,scheming and coordinating elaborate escape
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.52,0:10:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,plans with walkie-talkies\Nand other technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.60,0:10:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have been talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.92,0:10:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And now all the data he collected is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.66,0:10:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.00,0:10:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You rotten bitch, I'm gonna make you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.78,0:10:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, such passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.94,0:10:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad, after these next three things,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.30,0:10:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,even those fervent emotions will be\Nas lost as your chance at freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.10,0:10:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the beauty of\Nwhat Jailhouse Lock does.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.10,0:10:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat shit, Jolene Cujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.92,0:10:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.26,0:10:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of this hail of bullets, you're\Nonly gonna be aware of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.14,0:10:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest will pierce your\Nbody like knives into butter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.24,0:11:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You can try to fuck with my head all\Nyou want, but the reflection won't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.78,0:11:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how many shots you fire at once,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.32,0:11:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna see every single\None of them in the blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.14,0:11:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure you haven't\Nforgotten anything, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.10,0:11:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already destroyed the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.58,0:11:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My only choice is to bail out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.88,0:11:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene's going to forget me\Nin about two seconds anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.26,0:11:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be forgotten forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even a memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio, try to hang on a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.88,0:11:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going after that bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.26,0:11:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think you should, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.86,0:11:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We both know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.56,0:11:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.47,0:11:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,you're gonna forget again the\Nminute you leave this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.42,0:11:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're even gonna forget that\Nyou'll have to defeat her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:11:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So please...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.78,0:12:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.78,0:12:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand you wanting to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.82,0:12:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I like that about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How else were you gonna survive\Nthis shit-bucket prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.08,0:12:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You needed to be that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.28,0:12:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But still,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.38,0:12:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,eventually it's going to\Nget to the point where
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to make a move\Neven if it's risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.74,0:12:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've got to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,For me, that time is now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this Jolene's Thread?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.02,0:12:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.24,0:12:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd this happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.90,0:12:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But still,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.38,0:12:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,eventually it's going to get to the\Npoint Where you have to make a move,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,even if it's risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.70,0:12:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.10,0:12:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know I'm supposed to do\Nsomething really important.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:13:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Something like...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.16,0:13:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to print it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.82,0:13:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I need to tell Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.16,0:13:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll print it out and...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But what was it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.44,0:13:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What was the thing I'm supposed to print?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.26,0:13:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even have a printer in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.34,0:13:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So how can I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.80,0:13:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.08,0:13:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, she's the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.30,0:13:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not going to get\Naway from me this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.62,0:13:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back, I need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.70,0:13:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm at the stairs at D10!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.52,0:13:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.60,0:13:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They're right over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.60,0:13:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Beauty was being attacked!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.88,0:13:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The gate! Open it! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.66,0:14:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, where am I? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.88,0:14:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.26,0:14:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab her before she escapes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.52,0:14:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,They're chasing someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.54,0:14:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.24,0:14:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, I called\Nthe three guards back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.62,0:14:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now any and all memories you had of me\Nare lost forever, just like your freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.44,0:14:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.22,0:14:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up and run a bit, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll give them more of a reason\Nto put a bullet in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh right, those big strong arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.50,0:14:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I nearly forgot they can\Ndeflect any shots at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.30,0:14:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My official sworn duty is really only\Nto make sure Stand users get put away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.26,0:15:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm rather excited you're\Ngetting more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing you're about\Nto die makes me giddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.06,0:15:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone deserves it, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.14,0:15:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all because you refuse to\Nbehave and be a good little doggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.54,0:15:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I got her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.45,0:15:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, also, the fact that you can only\Nsee three guards in front of you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.46,0:15:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,is driving me wild with joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.66,0:15:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're never getting past my jailhouse\Nlock, so you might as well stop fighting it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.88,0:15:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jolene, when did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.10,0:15:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you. You're Emporio!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.60,0:15:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Jolene, you gotta know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.24,0:15:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This needs to be printed out, or else\NI was gonna forget it in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.34,0:15:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Print what out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.48,0:15:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in binary code.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.00,0:15:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The language only uses ones and zeros.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.38,0:15:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I calculated it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.38,0:15:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be able to print it out how\Nyou'd be able to understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.50,0:15:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What I'm saying is, you're the\Nprinter who can memorize it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Binary is universal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.94,0:16:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All things can be represented\Nwith numeric sequencing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.34,0:16:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If your thread can draw the\Nones and zeros exactly right,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.76,0:16:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,then Stone Ocean will become the printer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,that'll express it digitally.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.28,0:16:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I consider you to be the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.98,0:16:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, are you my enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.04,0:16:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.92,0:16:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, say your last goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.66,0:16:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.76,0:16:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You just confirmed it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.44,0:16:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.70,0:16:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.72,0:16:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell am I seeing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.18,0:17:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That psycho took Chief Miu Miu hostage!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.04,0:17:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.42,0:17:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I disabled Jailhouse\NLock's hold on you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.94,0:17:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.68,0:17:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.64,0:17:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I'm okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.71,0:17:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.10,0:17:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said before, I'm\Nbreaking out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.68,0:17:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.24,0:17:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If you insist on staying in this hole,\Nyou'd better get back to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.12,0:17:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.56,0:17:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I just realized now's my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.02,0:17:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see the outside world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.09,0:17:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a kid with her now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there a kid in this prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.02,0:17:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.93,0:17:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.78,0:17:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Emporio, you ready? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.40,0:17:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, you're in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.72,0:18:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.14,0:18:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.26,0:18:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please step aside, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.80,0:18:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.71,0:18:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Who am I aiming at, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.68,0:18:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why am I in the hallway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.00,0:18:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How did we all get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Miu Miu. Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.48,0:18:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You catch on quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.58,0:18:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost like you. First,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.36,0:18:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,we're going to head\Nstraight to the medical wing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.78,0:18:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,to treat the injuries\Nyou caused to Emporium.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.14,0:18:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm still counting on\Nyour magic jailhouse, Locke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.42,0:18:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on that invincible\Npower, the power of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.88,0:18:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.44,0:18:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You have Dad's disc, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.74,0:18:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've had it the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.56,0:18:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene! That you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.42,0:18:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, it is you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.96,0:18:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And Emporio 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.46,0:18:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.58,0:19:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognize the sound of that chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.48,0:19:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it had to be you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.76,0:19:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the carcass?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.26,0:19:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, she's the chief\Nguard of this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.78,0:19:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.92,0:19:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.83,0:19:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys saying you're about to...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.75,0:19:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's a prison break, and\Nwe're about to leave any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.98,0:19:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going after the priest, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.06,0:19:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, Hermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.50,0:19:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever that thing was he got his\Nhands on, I'm gonna go seal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.26,0:19:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm seeing this thing through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.08,0:19:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been more resolved than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.86,0:19:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I think you gotta take me with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.96,0:19:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.70,0:20:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.06,0:20:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How fortunate you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.80,0:20:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to ask, but are you unwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.34,0:20:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.30,0:20:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a bit fatigued, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.02,0:20:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, are you sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.44,0:20:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.38,0:21:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, what is happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.86,0:21:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with these eggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.20,0:21:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My stand. I haven't the\Nvaguest idea what it
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.50,0:21:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,is but it's painfully\Nclear that it's no longer
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.90,0:21:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Pale snake what is it what could it be i
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.78,0:21:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,feel terrible something\Nis quickly raging out
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.24,0:21:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,of Control inside of me there's some kind
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.14,0:21:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,of independent power\Nthat's ignoring my will
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.56,0:21:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But oddly i feel hope\Nin this power hope in
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.98,0:21:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,fact is the one and only\Nthing i feel from it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.38,0:21:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Dio's note recorded in Jotro's memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.36,0:21:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps that is what I need\Nto control this power, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.34,0:21:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The time and place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.74,0:21:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,North latitude 28 degrees, 24 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.80,0:21:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,West longitude 80 degrees, 36 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.60,0:21:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Delightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.64,0:21:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Heaven appears to be there after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.20,0:22:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And that place is at Cape Canaveral.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.76,0:22:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Kennedy Space Center, to be precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.44,0:22:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The time is the new\Nmoon, six days from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.52,0:22:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.80,0:22:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Other than he.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.48,0:22:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.78,0:22:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:22:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.68,0:23:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,About my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.94,0:23:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.64,0:23:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.50,0:23:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.94,0:23:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.14,0:23:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.32,0:23:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.74,0:23:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,From today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.04,0:23:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.82,0:24:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
